STEP 1: INSTALL PREREQUISITES
================================================================

Install the following:

1. Java JDK 21
2. Maven 3.9+
3. IntelliJ IDEA or Eclipse (optional)
4. Postman (optional)
5. MCP Inspector (for MCP testing)
6. Access to the investment external API
7. JWT issuer / authentication provider

Verify Java:

java -version

Expected:
Java 21

Verify Maven:

mvn -version

Expected:
Apache Maven 3.9+


STEP 2: CREATE PROJECT
================================================================

Create project directory:

mkdir investment-insights-mcp

cd investment-insights-mcp

